--========================================================
-- ✈ XEVRION HUB  (UI v25 - single LocalScript)
--  • v28 FIX: bombs waiting above the target no longer touch each other (own slot, 14 studs apart),
--    so none explodes in the air. Launch is ONE smooth rocket-like curve, dive accelerates smoothly.
--  • v27 FIX: the bomb no longer bounces up after touching the target. It dives straight THROUGH the
--    target and slams into the GROUND right under it, then keeps pushing down until it explodes.
--  • v26 FIX: NO SPIN on the hit. Bombs now dive perfectly STRAIGHT (nose first, no self-spin,
--    no curve). Spin power was removed. SWARM (tab 2): NEAT SPREAD = the bombs open into an evenly
--    spaced ring (equal gaps, same height), then they rush over the target and nuke-dive from above.
--    New row in tab 2: SPREAD RADIUS.
--  • v25 FIX: NO MORE CIRCLING after launch. The moment you launch / attack, ALL bombs fly
--    straight up at once, move over their target and wait there (hovering, not orbiting).
--    Then they dive one by one every BOMB INTERVAL seconds. Orbit is only for waiting BEFORE launch.
--  • v24: NEW ATTACK STYLE (tabs 2 / 3 / 4 / 5): every bomb first flies STRAIGHT UP, moves over the
--    target, then dives STRAIGHT DOWN on it (shape of the letter "n", like a nuke).
--    Bombs leave ONE BY ONE every BOMB INTERVAL seconds (default 1 s), they do NOT wait for the
--    previous bomb to explode. DIVE HEIGHT + BOMB INTERVAL are in every tab.
--  • v23: NEW TAB 5 = SCATTER: bombs orbit you, LAUNCH = they spiral outward while spinning,
--    then each bomb dashes at its OWN random player (1 bomb = 1 target)
--  • v23 FIX (all tabs): touching the target is NOT an explosion. The bomb only counts as
--    exploded when it disappears. If it is still there it bounces away and hits again.
--  • v22: MENU = 3 TABS:  1) DRONE   2) SWARM   3) ORBIT TARGET (drone and swarm are separate now)
--  • v22 SWARM: up to 8 bombs, orbit radius up to 30, wavy orbit,
--    after the scatter the bombs dive on the target ONE BY ONE
--  • v22 ORBIT TARGET: pick the target from the menu list, bombs orbit it from far away
--    (30+ studs, wavy), ATTACK = faster and faster spin for 3 s, then they hit the target
--  • Flight / bomb physics unchanged
--  • UI EDITOR: move, resize, reset every HUD element (incl. NEXT button)
--  • HUD layout + settings AUTO-SAVE (writefile on executors,
--    LocalStorageService as backup) and AUTO-LOAD on every run
--  • Lock-on (PLAYERS only): head aim, camera centers target,
--    lock box lines up with target, bomb detonates on target
--  • v15: NEXT TARGET (button / T), friend check
--  • v16: lock always picks the NEAREST target (any distance, no lock area)
--  • v16: menu is scrollable; FOV + camera distance use [-] [+] buttons (no sliders)
--  • v19: BOOST button / B key = temporary speed burst (2 s) + cooldown (5 s), BOOST POWER [-] [+]
--  • v20: SWARM STRIKE = up to 6 bombs orbit ABOVE you, LAUNCH -> scatter upward -> auto-homing
--  • v21: SWARM panel: drag the title bar, [-] [+] resize, [▲/▼] collapse (all saved)
--  • v17: CAMERA SENSITIVITY [-] [+]
--  • v17: 2 languages (ENGLISH / INDONESIA), saved
--  • v15: SPEED FX (camera shake, speed lines, FOV kick)
--  • v15: radar zoom 400 / 800 / 1500 (tap radar or press R)
--  • v15: speed + all settings saved
--  • v15: NO SIGNAL glitch screen (1 second, with sound) after explosion
--  • Stays under Luau's 200 top-level locals limit
